    "title": "Normal Sweet Corn Circus returning to Uptown Normal Aug. 22-23 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jason Howell ,\n12 hours ago NORMAL (25News Now) - The Sweet Corn Circus celebrating the circus and agriculture roots of Bloomington-Normal returns to Uptown Normal this weekend. The Sweet Corn Circus festival will feature live performances throughout the weekend including acrobats, clowns, aerial arts, professional wrestling, live music and more. Featured performers include Gamma Phi Circus, CirqueMania and Iron Spirit Pro Wrestling. Read full article\n1",
